guide forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk
title Orb of Soran'ruk
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 25-30
zone The Barrens
keywords The Orb of Soran'ruk, Doan Karhan, Soran'ruk Fragment, Large Soran'ruk Fragment, Orb of Soran'ruk, Staff of Soran'ruk, Blackfathom Deeps, Shadowfang Keep, Twilight Acolyte, Shadowfang Darksoul, Warlock, class weapon
reward item 6898 15109
why A rare off-hand orb or staff for your late 20s, for fragments from two dungeons.

# The Orb of Soran'ruk (1740): Doan Karhan in the Barrens wants three Soran'ruk
# Fragments from the Twilight Acolytes in Blackfathom Deeps and a Large
# Soran'ruk Fragment from the Shadowfang Darksouls in Shadowfang Keep, and
# lets you choose the Orb of Soran'ruk (off-hand) or the Staff of Soran'ruk.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for Doan Karhan and the drops; dungeons.json for the two
# dungeon entrances; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): unchanged in Forever,
# level 25, needs 20, 2550 experience.
# Both fragments come from elite dungeon mobs: this chain needs a dungeon
# group, or two. The Large Fragment drops from one Darksoul in five.

step Doan Karhan
  tip Doan Karhan camps in the southern Barrens, east of the road north-east of Camp Taurajo.
  level 20
  accept 1740                         -- Doan Karhan

step Blackfathom Deeps
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Twilight Acolytes inside Blackfathom Deeps, a level 24-32 dungeon, each drop a Soran'ruk Fragment: bring a group. The entrance is in the ruins on the north-west coast of Ashenvale.
  collect 6914 quest 1740.1 @14.5,14.2 live -- Soran'ruk Fragment, from the Twilight Acolytes

step Shadowfang Keep
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip The Shadowfang Darksouls inside Shadowfang Keep, a level 20-30 dungeon, drop the Large Fragment about one time in five: bring a group. The keep stands south of the Sepulcher.
  collect 6915 quest 1740.2 @44.8,67.8 live -- Large Soran'ruk Fragment, from the Shadowfang Darksouls

step Back to Doan Karhan
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1740 choose 6898 15109       -- Doan Karhan
